## LIZA AI Assistant - Local Android SDK Configuration
##
## Copy or rename this file to 'local.properties' in the project root:
##   cp local.properties.example local.properties
##
## Set the 'sdk.dir' key to your local Android SDK directory.
##
## Linux / Generic placeholder:
sdk.dir=/home/user/Android/Sdk
##
## Termux (Android CLI) Configuration:
## If building inside Termux on Android, install or unpack the Android SDK command-line tools
## into your Termux home directory, and set sdk.dir to:
## sdk.dir=/data/data/com.termux/files/home/android-sdk
##
## macOS:
## sdk.dir=/Users/user/Library/Android/sdk
##
## Windows:
## sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\user\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
